    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ca3unmo",
      "content": "Human anatomy studies the structure of the human body and the relationship between organs and systems. For RRB Nursing and other nursing recruitment exams, questions commonly appear from bones, organs, glands, cranial nerves, and body systems."
    },
    {
